<title>CHINA: China to grant RMB licence to three foreign banks.</title>
<headline>China to grant RMB licence to three foreign banks.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>China will grant licences to three foreign banks this month to do local currency renminbi business, the official Shanghai Star newspaper reported on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
